{"title":"Career Roadmap · Entertainment Reporter","role":"Entertainment Reporter","summary":"An Entertainment Reporter covers the film, television, streaming, music and popular-culture industries. The role combines journalism, entertainment knowledge, interviewing, research, storytelling and digital media production.","facts":{"Current degree":"BJMC / B.A. Journalism & Mass Communication","Course":"Film Studies / Cinema Journalism"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Entertainment Reporter covers the film, television, streaming, music and popular-culture industries. The role combines journalism, entertainment knowledge, interviewing, research, storytelling and digital media production."},{"type":"p","text":"An Entertainment Reporter may cover:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film releases"},{"text":"Movie reviews and features"},{"text":"Celebrity interviews"},{"text":"Film festivals"},{"text":"Red-carpet events"},{"text":"Press conferences"},{"text":"OTT releases"},{"text":"Television"},{"text":"Music and concerts"},{"text":"Pop-culture trends"},{"text":"Film-industry business"},{"text":"Awards and industry events"},{"text":"Behind-the-scenes stories"},{"text":"Entertainment controversies and public-interest stories"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential employers include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Magazines"},{"text":"Television news channels"},{"text":"Entertainment websites"},{"text":"Digital news platforms"},{"text":"OTT/content companies"},{"text":"Radio organizations"},{"text":"Film publications"},{"text":"YouTube media channels"},{"text":"Independent digital media outlets"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["The strongest modern profile combines journalism","film literacy","digital storytelling","multimedia production","audience analytics."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","BJMC /